<figure
  class="bb-observable-decision-diagram"
  aria-label="Observable decision coverage compares captured runtime evidence from tests exercising two decision arms"
>
  <div
    class="bb-observable-decision-diagram__viewport"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Scrollable observable decision coverage diagram"
    tabindex="0"
  >
    <svg viewBox="0 0 960 500" role="img" aria-labelledby="bb-odc-title bb-odc-desc">
    <title id="bb-odc-title">Observable decision coverage compares evidence from two decision arms</title>
    <desc id="bb-odc-desc">
      A subscription decision splits into a known-user test and an unknown-user
      test. Each test produces canonical captured span shapes. Blackbox compares
      the two arm-bucket signatures. Different signatures produce propagating,
      identical signatures produce masking-candidate, and an untested arm
      produces coverage-gap.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker
        id="bb-odc-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#94a3b8"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect x="8" y="8" width="944" height="484" rx="18" fill="#111827" stroke="#374151"></rect>
    <text x="36" y="44" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="20" font-weight="800">
      Both arms ran. Did they leave distinguishable evidence?
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="70" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="13">
      Blackbox compares canonical span-shape multisets from tests exercising each arm.
    </text>

    <rect x="370" y="94" width="220" height="58" rx="8" fill="#1f2937" stroke="#94a3b8"></rect>
    <text x="480" y="118" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="12" font-weight="700">
      BINARY DECISION
    </text>
    <text x="480" y="139" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="15" font-weight="800">
      user found?
    </text>

    <path
      d="M410 152 C390 174 304 174 280 198"
      fill="none"
      stroke="#60a5fa"
      stroke-width="2"
      marker-end="url(#bb-odc-arrow)"
    ></path>
    <path
      d="M550 152 C570 174 656 174 680 198"
      fill="none"
      stroke="#c084fc"
      stroke-width="2"
      marker-end="url(#bb-odc-arrow)"
    ></path>

    <text x="347" y="174" text-anchor="middle" fill="#93c5fd" font-size="11" font-weight="700">
      YES
    </text>
    <text x="613" y="174" text-anchor="middle" fill="#d8b4fe" font-size="11" font-weight="700">
      NO
    </text>

    <rect x="40" y="196" width="400" height="154" rx="8" fill="#172554" stroke="#60a5fa"></rect>
    <text x="62" y="222" fill="#eff6ff" font-size="15" font-weight="800">subscribe-flow</text>
    <text x="62" y="242" fill="#bfdbfe" font-size="11">tests the known-user arm</text>
    <text x="62" y="270" fill="#93c5fd" font-size="11" font-weight="700">
      SELECTED CAPTURED SPAN SHAPES
    </text>
    <rect x="62" y="282" width="161" height="25" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569"></rect>
    <text x="142.5" y="299" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10">
      HTTP POST payment
    </text>
    <rect x="233" y="282" width="183" height="25" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569"></rect>
    <text x="324.5" y="299" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10">
      Postgres INSERT subscription
    </text>
    <rect x="62" y="315" width="161" height="25" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569"></rect>
    <text x="142.5" y="332" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10">
      Redis SET cache
    </text>
    <rect x="233" y="315" width="183" height="25" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569"></rect>
    <text x="324.5" y="332" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10">
      SQS SEND subscription-orders
    </text>

    <rect x="520" y="196" width="400" height="154" rx="8" fill="#3b1553" stroke="#c084fc"></rect>
    <text x="542" y="222" fill="#faf5ff" font-size="15" font-weight="800">
      subscribe-unknown-user
    </text>
    <text x="542" y="242" fill="#e9d5ff" font-size="11">tests the missing-user arm</text>
    <text x="542" y="270" fill="#d8b4fe" font-size="11" font-weight="700">
      SELECTED CAPTURED SPAN SHAPES
    </text>
    <rect x="542" y="282" width="218" height="25" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569"></rect>
    <text x="651" y="299" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10">
      Postgres SELECT users
    </text>
    <rect x="770" y="282" width="126" height="25" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569"></rect>
    <text x="833" y="299" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10">
      no later effects
    </text>
    <text x="542" y="330" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="11">
      No payment, insert, cache write, or queue publish appears.
    </text>

    <path
      d="M240 350 C240 372 325 376 350 390"
      fill="none"
      stroke="#60a5fa"
      stroke-width="2"
      marker-end="url(#bb-odc-arrow)"
    ></path>
    <path
      d="M720 350 C720 372 635 376 610 390"
      fill="none"
      stroke="#c084fc"
      stroke-width="2"
      marker-end="url(#bb-odc-arrow)"
    ></path>

    <rect x="286" y="388" width="388" height="54" rx="8" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#fbbf24"></rect>
    <text x="480" y="410" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fef3c7" font-size="13" font-weight="800">
      Compare canonical arm-bucket signatures
    </text>
    <text x="480" y="429" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fde68a" font-size="11">
      these signatures differ
    </text>

    <line
      x1="674"
      y1="415"
      x2="744"
      y2="415"
      stroke="#86efac"
      stroke-width="2"
      marker-end="url(#bb-odc-arrow)"
    ></line>
    <rect x="756" y="388" width="164" height="54" rx="8" fill="#14532d" stroke="#86efac"></rect>
    <text x="838" y="410" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bbf7d0" font-size="11" font-weight="700">
      VERDICT
    </text>
    <text x="838" y="430" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0fdf4" font-size="14" font-weight="800">
      propagating
    </text>

    <text x="40" y="468" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="11" font-weight="700">OTHER RESULTS</text>
    <text x="151" y="468" fill="#fde68a" font-size="11">
      same signatures → masking-candidate
    </text>
    <text x="405" y="468" fill="#fca5a5" font-size="11">
      one arm missing → coverage-gap
    </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Blackbox compares the full captured evidence attached to tests in each arm
    bucket. The result is correlated runtime evidence, not a causal data-flow
    proof from the decision to a particular effect.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

